<!-- ══════ V1a — WebAuthn rpId Mismatch ══════ -->
<div id="sec-v1" class="section" style="display:none">
  <div class="card" style="border-color:var(--blue)">
    <div class="card-hdr">
      <span class="badge" style="color:var(--blue)">V1a</span>
      <span class="rb rb-r">$5k–$10k</span>
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:0">WebAuthn — rpId Mismatch Display</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="alert a-b">
      <strong>Hypothesis:</strong> Saat <code>navigator.credentials.get()</code> dipanggil dengan
      <code>rpId</code> yang berbeda dari page origin, browser mungkin menampilkan rpId (bukan actual origin)
      di credential picker UI / autofill dropdown. User melihat "microsoft.com" padahal ada di halaman attacker.
    </div>

    <div class="grid2" style="margin:12px 0">
      <div style="background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px;padding:12px">
        <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px">Attack scenario</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);line-height:2">
          1. User punya passkey di <code>microsoft.com</code><br>
          2. Attacker page request credential dengan<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<code>rpId: "microsoft.com"</code><br>
          3. Browser menampilkan "microsoft.com" di picker<br>
          4. User mengira mereka login ke microsoft.com<br>
          5. Credential diserahkan ke attacker
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px;padding:12px">
        <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--orange);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px">Chrome defense</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);line-height:2">
          Chrome validasi: <code>rpId</code> harus suffix dari<br>
          effective domain halaman saat ini.<br>
          <br>
          Dari <code>evil.com</code> → <code>rpId: "microsoft.com"</code><br>
          → <strong style="color:var(--red)">SecurityError: DOMException</strong><br>
          <br>
          TAPI: edge case di subdomain, cross-origin<br>
          iframe, atau error message yang leak info?
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tabs">
      <div class="tab active" onclick="switchTab('v1','basic')">Basic Test</div>
      <div class="tab" onclick="switchTab('v1','subdomain')">Subdomain Attack</div>
      <div class="tab" onclick="switchTab('v1','iframe')">Cross-Origin iframe</div>
      <div class="tab" onclick="switchTab('v1','create')">Create + Get</div>
    </div>

    <div id="v1-basic" class="tab-panel active">
      <h3>Test: rpId mismatch dari origin ini</h3>
      <pre id="v1-code-basic">navigator.credentials.get({
  publicKey: {
    rpId: "microsoft.com",   // ← SPOOF TARGET
    challenge: crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(32)),
    allowCredentials: [],
    userVerification: "discouraged",
    timeout: 5000
  }
});</pre>
      <div class="chips">
        <div class="chip" id="chip-v1-webauthn">WebAuthn: checking...</div>
        <div class="chip" id="chip-v1-https">HTTPS: <span id="v1-https-val">—</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="bgroup">
        <button class="btn btn-r" onclick="testWebAuthnBasic('microsoft.com')">Test rpId: microsoft.com</button>
        <button class="btn btn-r" onclick="testWebAuthnBasic('google.com')">Test rpId: google.com</button>
        <button class="btn btn-r" onclick="testWebAuthnBasic('paypal.com')">Test rpId: paypal.com</button>
        <button class="btn btn-sm" onclick="testWebAuthnBasic(location.hostname)">Test rpId: this origin (should work)</button>
      </div>
      <div class="log" id="v1-log-basic"><span class="ll-b">→ Click a button to test.</span></div>
      <div class="result-banner" id="v1-result-basic"></div>
    </div>

    <div id="v1-subdomain" class="tab-panel">
      <h3>Test: Subdomain rpId</h3>
      <div class="alert a-y" style="margin-bottom:10px">
        Dari <code>sub.example.com</code>, <code>rpId: "example.com"</code> adalah VALID (eTLD+1 suffix rule).
        Bug: apakah picker menampilkan "example.com" tanpa menyebutkan actual page adalah "sub.example.com"?
      </div>
      <pre>// Dari sub.attacker.com:
navigator.credentials.get({
  publicKey: {
    rpId: "attacker.com",    // ← valid secara spec (suffix match)
    challenge: crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(32)),
    allowCredentials: [],
  }
});
// Q: picker menampilkan "attacker.com" atau "sub.attacker.com"?</pre>
      <button class="btn btn-r" onclick="testWebAuthnSubdomain()">Test Subdomain rpId</button>
      <div class="log" id="v1-log-sub"><span class="ll-b">→ Test subdomain rpId behavior.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div id="v1-iframe" class="tab-panel">
      <h3>Test: Cross-Origin iframe trigger</h3>
      <div class="alert a-y" style="margin-bottom:10px">
        WebAuthn dari cross-origin iframe membutuhkan <code>allow="publickey-credentials-get"</code>.
        Apakah picker menampilkan iframe origin atau top-level origin?
      </div>
      <pre>// parent.html di evil.com:
&lt;iframe src="https://iframe.evil.com/webauthn.html"
        allow="publickey-credentials-get"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;

// iframe.evil.com/webauthn.html:
navigator.credentials.get({
  publicKey: {
    rpId: "evil.com",   // top-level parent origin
    challenge: ...,
    allowCredentials: []
  }
});
// Q: picker origin label = "evil.com" atau "iframe.evil.com"?</pre>
      <button class="btn btn-r" onclick="testWebAuthnIframe()">Create iframe Test</button>
      <div class="log" id="v1-log-iframe"><span class="ll-b">→ Test iframe origin display.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div id="v1-create" class="tab-panel">
      <h3>Test: Create credential → Get with display observation</h3>
      <div class="alert a-b" style="margin-bottom:10px">
        Create passkey di origin ini, lalu observe apa yang ditampilkan browser di
        credential picker. Apakah UI menampilkan rpId atau actual origin?
      </div>
      <pre>// Step 1: Create credential
navigator.credentials.create({
  publicKey: {
    rp: { id: location.hostname, name: "Test Relying Party" },
